  "principles": [
    "Two everyday hue families: blue forecasts/actions and green quota/banks; reduce hue count without desaturating the chart.",
    "Both forecast tracks use readable Indigo tones; the second also uses a dashed curve.",
    "Quota retains a pale green fill and green outline; bank events share the same green family.",
    "Tomato is reserved for expiry/overwrite/depletion risks and errors.",
    "Light surfaces and limited colored fill keep the focus on chart data; ordinary bank cards stay white."
  ],
  "revision": {
    "reason": "Correct the gray interpretation: consolidate color roles into blue and green, with risk-only red.",
